 "emoji": "🧊",
 "sentences": [
  "Greenland hides a massive, secret valley network.",
  "Scientists used ice surface bumps to map bedrock buried under 3 kilometers of ice.",
  "They discovered 1,943 subglacial valleys, with a third identified for the first time.",
  "Some valleys stretch hundreds of kilometers further inland than previously thought.",
  "These deep canyons likely formed from ancient groundwater before the ice sheet even existed.",
  "Mapping these hidden paths helps predict how Greenland's ice will move in the future."
